TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":493008378,"text":"そうだそうだ、薬を売る同業者ですら騙すなんて、とんでもない悪いやつだな！","nextNodeIds":[710410112]},{"nodeId":710410112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3364297962,"text":"「トクレイポン」の偽名は？","nextNodeIds":[710410113]},{"nodeId":710410113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":1679256906,"text":"クレイトポン！","nextNodeIds":[710410114]},{"nodeId":710410114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":1900518714,"text":"…あっ、いや…クレイトポンは偽名じゃなくて、本名だが…","nextNodeIds":[710410115]},{"nodeId":710410115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":20076210,"text":"それじゃ、トクレイポンは偽名なのか…？","nextNodeIds":[710410116]},{"nodeId":710410116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":2431814914,"text":"いや…や、やつが俺の名前を偽って使ってるもんだから、クレイトポンが偽名になったんだ。分かったか？","nextNodeIds":[710410117]},{"nodeId":710410117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3342503754,"text":"なるほど…だから、「トクレイポン」が本名になったってわけだな。","nextNodeIds":[710410118]},{"nodeId":710410118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2262927866,"text":"残念だね…","nextNodeIds":[710410119]},{"nodeId":710410119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":4069812306,"text":"何が残念なんだ？","nextNodeIds":[710410120]},{"nodeId":710410120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":4151047970,"text":"あと少しで、自白をとれる所だったんですけどね。","nextNodeIds":[710410121]},{"nodeId":710410121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":4018943778,"text":"彼を上に連れて行って、千岩軍のお兄さんたちに事情を聞いてもらいましょう。","nextNodeIds":[710410122]},{"nodeId":710410122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2081171802,"text":"あるいは、ここで彼を始末する。","nextNodeIds":[710410123]},{"nodeId":710410123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":3958972090,"text":"はい？","nextNodeIds":[710410124]},{"nodeId":710410124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":3426685402,"text":"ちょ、ちょっとまて。そんな冗談はよせよ！","nextNodeIds":[710410125]},{"nodeId":710410125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3934105586,"text":"へへっ、面白いぜ。","nextNodeIds":[710410126]},{"nodeId":710410126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":2887125642,"text":"おい、お前もまったく笑ってないじゃないか！全然面白くない！","nextNodeIds":[710410127,710410130]},{"nodeId":710410127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":642283282,"text":"確かに面白くない。だから、本気でいく。","nextNodeIds":[710410128]},{"nodeId":710410128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":1056181154,"text":"先輩、落ち着いてください！今は拷問の時間ではありません！","nextNodeIds":[710410129]},{"nodeId":710410129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":3650964026,"text":"あなたたちに気絶させられた宝盗団を背負って走り回るのはごめんですからね…とりあえず、彼を連れて拠点に戻りましょう。","nextNodeIds":[710410131]},{"nodeId":710410131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":1073452674,"text":"待ってくれ、きっとお前たちの役に立つから！俺を探検隊に加えてくれないか？ほら…俺はもう、宝盗団に捨てられたんだ…","nextNodeIds":[710410132]},{"nodeId":710410132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":53937626,"text":"だから…今の俺は、一応潔白って言えるだろ！","nextNodeIds":[710410133]},{"nodeId":710410133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":143466530,"text":"これが潔白って言えるのか…","nextNodeIds":[710410134]},{"nodeId":710410134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":1185184202,"text":"あなた、何ができますか？","nextNodeIds":[710410135]},{"nodeId":710410135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":3284556274,"text":"そうだな…例えば…爆薬の調合とか？","nextNodeIds":[710410136]},{"nodeId":710410136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1350673098,"text":"やっぱ偽薬じゃないか…","nextNodeIds":[710410137]},{"nodeId":710410137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3991443058,"text":"偽薬じゃなくて爆薬。","nextNodeIds":[710410138]},{"nodeId":710410138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":3475746010,"text":"偽爆薬ではないですか？","nextNodeIds":[710410139]},{"nodeId":710410139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":2901334874,"text":"今度は本物だ！","nextNodeIds":[710410140]},{"nodeId":710410140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":4251183930,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[710410141]},{"nodeId":710410141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":1193083658,"text":"…私にはあなたをチームに加える権限がありません。あなたのような人をどう処置するかは、瑾武姉さんに判断してもらいます。きっと、彼女も千岩軍に引き渡そうとすると思いますけど。","nextNodeIds":[710410142]},{"nodeId":710410142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":3664059930,"text":"でも、私たちはしっかり見張っていきますからね。宝盗団のやつなんて、どう考えても信頼できません。偽薬を売ってるようなやつなら、尚更です…","nextNodeIds":[710410143]},{"nodeId":710410143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"クレイトポン","textMapHash":863823074,"text":"だから、偽薬は売ってないって！","nextNodeIds":[710410144]},{"nodeId":710410144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4082179362,"text":"はいはい、分かったぞ！早く行こうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710410130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":263473274,"text":"一理ある。","nextNodeIds":[710410131]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7104101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN"